 },
 "summary": "A five-pole female XLR receptacle in a round plastic body, for rear panel mounting and horizontal PCB mounting. A dedicated ground contact connects the shell of the mating plug to the front panel. The contacts are tulip-shaped CuSn6 bronze, hard gold plated where they mate and tin plated where they solder; a nickel-plated steel latch holds the plug. Receptacles can sit 23 mm apart centre to centre. The NC5FAH1 is its direct replacement.",
